<div style="padding: 40px;">
    <img src="https://vorkana.com/logo-dark.png" alt="Vorkana" width="140" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
    
    <h1 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Confirm your email address
    </h1>
    
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        Hello {{name}},<br><br>
        To complete your Vorkana profile and start connecting with opportunities, please click the button below to verify your email.
    </p>

    <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" style="background-color: #10b981; color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block;">
        Verify Email Address
    </a>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 32px;">
        This link will expire in {{expiresIn}}. If you did not create a Vorkana account, you can safely ignore this email.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<div class="alert alert-danger mt-8">
    <div class="alert-content">
        <div class="alert-title">Security Notice</div>
        <p class="message-secondary">
            <strong>Didn't create this account?</strong> 
            If you didn't sign up for Vorkana, you can safely ignore this email. 
            The account will be automatically removed if not verified within {{expiresIn}}.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<p class="message text-center">
    Need assistance? Our support team is here to help.<br>
    Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #10b981; font-weight: 500;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
</p>